   "walk_rule": "Enter on-axis at the top and the hero is already visible 28 cells away through every door gap; the 3-wide central nave carries the flow straight to the raised hero chamber, while offset side doors peel viewers into 3-cell-wide cabinet rooms and return them to the axis one bay deeper.",
